    "copy_media_jQehM4": {
      "type": "copy-media",
      "settings": {
        "lg_bg_color": "lg:bg-white",
        "bg_color": "bg-white",
        "text": "<p>Every day, we’re exposed to more toxic chemicals than ever before. As surfers, we spend hours under the relentless sun, in the water, and exposed to elements that demand the highest level of protection. Most sunscreens? They rely on chemical filters. Developed to meet Kelly Slater’s rigorous standards, Freaks of Nature is a 100% mineral sunscreen with bio-based and science backed ingredients. We’re gentler on the skin, particularly for surfers who are faced with harsh environmental elements such as UV rays, wind, and saltwater. Our proprietary formulation ensures that the skin barrier is supported rather than compromised, making FON ideal for sensitive skin and daily use.</p><p><a href=\"https://freaksofnature.com/collections/all-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://freaksofnature.com/collections/all-products\"><em>SHOP NOW </em></a></p>",
        "expansion_text": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/02_SLATER_1144_rt1_12e02684-b5d3-4695-b89a-e33ff261a5e0.jpg",
